# Xan'tish's snakes in Orgrimmar.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, three snakes; the new Jungle Boa); Forever client
# 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse prices; every pet item teaches its
# companion when used).

step Xan'tish
  tip Xan'tish sells four snakes in Orgrimmar (50s each); the Jungle Boa is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8404                         -- Xan'tish
  buy 10360 npc 8404 optional         -- Black Kingsnake, 50s
  buy 10361 npc 8404 optional         -- Brown Snake, 50s
  buy 10392 npc 8404 optional         -- Crimson Snake, 50s
  buy 280703 "Jungle Boa" npc 8404 optional -- 50s
